d Solitarchs, which are then connected with House Goratrix, House Carna and House Ipsissimus along with other indipendenti Thaumaturges.<br /> <br /> Karl Schreckt Is mentioned as a Traditionalist leader, bit House Goratrix Is established quote firmly as the backbone of Pyramid nostalgia.<br /> <br /> \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bAll of this Is a bit ... unexpected?<br /> <br /> That said, Blood Sigils Is a very good book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12590,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","user":"Manfr","date":". 10-09-2023, 12:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-09T09:36:33-07:00","id":1523880,"title":"","content":"It seems like an interesting and very dense book. Didn't have time to deep dive into it, but parts of it are looking cool (not the whole &quot;Dude, do you Bru?&quot;, though). Also, was suprised to see in credits that Hite is the Dev and one of the authors and that they also got Greg Stolze in on the writing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-09T12:36:23-07:00","id":1523883,"title":"","content":"I'm still making my way through the book. Doesn't seem too bad so far.<br /> <br /> The &quot;Hungarian fascists&quot;-bit is weird 